{
 "uid": "utm-obs-00-executive",
 "title": "00 - UTM Executive Platform Overview",
 "description": "**Purpose:** single-screen operational summary of the UTM platform, with drill-down to every detailed dashboard via the *UTM Observability* menu.\n\n**Data sources:** Prometheus (kube-state-metrics, node-exporter, ceph-mgr), Elasticsearch core-es7 (uas_9.0.0, operation-plan-wrapper, operation-plan-result), utm-generic-statistics.\n\n**Known limitations:** UTM application services are NOT instrumented into Prometheus, so no service-level RED metrics exist. Application logs are unavailable. See *08 - Observability Coverage*.\n\n**Interpretation:** business-data KPIs (zones, plans, events) reflect historical datasets and are not live telemetry — check *Data Freshness* on each detail dashboard.",
 "tags": [
  "utm-observability",
  "executive"
 ],
